{"id":"65571e2c2132ae57","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-thm-huge.md","title":"Huge Cardinal","display":"thm-huge — Huge Cardinal","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-huge","aliases":["58-thm-huge"],"display":"thm-huge — Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[58-df-huge]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-huge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-huge</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-huge — Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"58-df-huge\">58-df-huge</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> are metatheoretic class parameters</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Huge}\">\\(\\mathrm{Huge}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}\">\\(\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}\\)</span> are imported from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"641a3566187bf66b\" href=\"?note=641a3566187bf66b\" title=\"58-df-huge\">58-df-huge</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathbf V\\to M\">\\(j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\)</span> is class-function notation, and closure quantifies only set-coded functions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land j:\\mathbf V\\to M\n\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land j:\\mathbf V\\to M\n\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the defining embedding consequence with\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\">\\(\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\\)</span> and closure under <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-sequences.  The former\nassertion left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> free and quantified a proper-class embedding as\nthough it were a ZFC set.</li>\n<li>The imported elementarity symbol and critical-point expansion are used verbatim; the conclusion also records transitivity of the target class.</li>\n<li>Huge cardinals are among the strongest large cardinals.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-huge","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-huge]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-huge","status":"resolved","id":"641a3566187bf66b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$, $\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}$, and $\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}$ are imported from [[58-df-huge]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Huge}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"j:\\mathbf V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}huge}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\to\n\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nM\\subseteq\\mathbf V\n\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\n\\land j:\\mathbf V\\to M\n\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,\\mathbf V,M)\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\n\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\n\\land\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\n\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\to f\\in M\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda=j(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false}],"bytes":1444,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4213","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-thm-huge.md|58-thm-huge]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["641a3566187bf66b"]}